{"ref":"BDB, עַזּוּר","hw":"עַזּוּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַזּוּר</span></big>  and (once) <span dir=\"rtl\">עַזֻּר</span> <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Αζωρ, Εζερ, Ιαζερ:<br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Hananiah <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">Je 28:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עַזֻּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 11:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.11.1\">Ez 11:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a chief of people <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.18\">Ne 10:18</a>.","next":"BDB, עֲזַרְאֵל","prev":"BDB, עֶזְרָה²"}